                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game runs at around 47 FPS on a GTX 1080 on medium settings. If you alt tab, the battery and stamina meter disappear. If you click \"Return to menu\" and try to start a new game, it crashes. The 1 monster has a predetermined path, so if you simply stand to the side, it will walk right by you. Items needed to complete the game can randomly despawn. Once you learn the location of the items, and the game doesn't crash or other bugs don't happen, you can beat the game in less than 3 minutes.\n\nBasically this is a pile of shit and shouldn't be on steam.",
